    commonMisunderstandings:['Vedānta is not identical with Advaita.','Śaṅkara did not found Vedānta.','Viśiṣṭādvaita and Dvaita are rival systems, not incomplete steps toward Advaita.','The Upaniṣads are layered texts, not one unambiguous creed.','Modern claims that all religions teach one Vedānta truth are contested receptions, not a classical consensus.'],
