    internalDebates:['What identity statements mean and how negation functions','Whether difference is ultimate, qualified, both different and nondifferent, or sublated','How ignorance or bondage arises and ends','Whether liberated individuality remains','How divine grace and finite agency interact','How traditional eligibility and social boundaries should be interpreted or transformed'],
